00:27:03.680 --> 00:27:33.950
<v Jaime Lowe>And he held a knife to my side, and then he put his hands down my boxers and felt my vagina. And then I think I said something about, like, protesting. And he said that my father owed him money. And I was like, there's no way that's true.
