00:58:24.210 --> 00:58:48.790
<v Ira Glass>Special thanks to Emily Dworkin, Patricia Resick, Henry Schwartz, and Shawn Bishop. Original music for today's show by Daniel Hart. Our website, thisamericanlife.org, where you can stream our archive of over 680 episodes for absolutely free. Also there's videos and tons of other stuff there, too. Or get our app, which has all that stuff and also lets you download as many episodes as you want. Again, thisamericanlife.org.
<v Ira Glass>特别感谢艾米丽·德沃金、帕特里夏·雷西克、亨利·施瓦茨和肖恩·毕晓普。今天节目的原创音乐由丹尼尔·哈特制作。访问我们的网站thisamericanlife.org，你可以免费在线收听我们超过680集的存档。那里还有视频和大量其他内容。或者获取我们的应用程序，它拥有所有这些内容，并允许你随心所欲地下载任意集数。再次说明，thisamericanlife.org。

00:58:48.790 --> 00:59:07.370
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. He took some ayahuasca before painting his own apartment-- not a good idea. He was getting the primer ready, and he said one of the walls started talking to him that said--
<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由公共广播交换中心（PRX）分发给各公共广播电台。一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托雷·马拉蒂亚先生。他在粉刷自己的公寓前吸食了死藤水——这不是个好主意。他准备好底漆时，他说其中一面墙开始对他说话，说——

00:59:07.370 --> 00:59:10.240
<v Debra Kaysen>I hate to tell you this, but I'm really treatment resistant.
<v Debra Kaysen>我讨厌告诉你这一点，但我真的很“治疗抗拒”。

00:59:10.240 --> 00:59:14.260
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回《美国生活》的更多故事。

00:59:14.260 --> 00:59:19.260
